bbq-predictor (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=low

  * Publish from bbq-predictor-publish, built on QtCore, QtNetwork and
    QtSql alone, so a server needs no display and no desktop libraries.
    The applet refuses --publish and the signing-key options by name.
  * Move the five-minute round -- the timer, the cron line, its
    configuration and the bbq-predictor account -- to bbq-predictor-server,
    and run the publisher from it.

 -- Nabeel Sowan <nabeel@vibes.se>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:03:09 +0200

bbq-predictor (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * First package.  Installs the applet and a systemd timer that fetches
    the bands on its own clock, so the archive advances and verification
    accumulates without the window being open.

 -- Nabeel Sowan <nabeel@vibes.se>  Fri, 04 Sep 2026 13:20:14 +0200
